# Proof: F-V2-CAPTURE
# Top: protocol_capture_v2
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; arbitrary sampling and control inputs.
# Properties: Bounds, truncation, invalid read masking, and stopped-state stability.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v2_capture.v
prep -top protocol_capture_v2
flatten
memory_map
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
